cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, cite both this software and its model/optimizer sources."
title: "Muon for Dense-Retriever Adaptation"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reproducible AdamW, Muon, and NorMuon experiments for supervised DenseOn
  retriever adaptation, including five-stage decontaminated BEIR dynamics and
  weight/function-space mechanism analyses.
keywords:
  - dense retrieval
  - embedding models
  - AdamW
  - Muon
  - NorMuon
authors:
